Third-party components retain their own licences. The models this pipeline is
designed to run are licensed separately by their publishers, and the licence
terms of each must be reviewed before deployment:

  ivrit-ai/whisper-large-v3-turbo-ct2          Apache-2.0
  pyannote/speaker-diarization-community-1     CC-BY-4.0 (weights),
                                               MIT (pyannote.audio code)
  dicta-il/dictabert-ner (optional, NER)       see its model card
  the judge LLM                                varies by the model chosen

The licence each model's own card declares is recorded, at download time, in
models/MODELS_MANIFEST.json. Several candidate judge models ship under
bespoke community licences with usage restrictions rather than OSI
open-source licences; the one actually chosen must be reviewed.

